[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "お疲れ！\u3000これで運び込む予定の荷物もおしまいだ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Great work! That's the last of the cargo we needed to move."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "調査団員Ｂ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Survey Team Member B"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "よ、よかったですぅ……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Oh, thank g-goodness..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レイニャ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lenja"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "わ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Oh!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レイニャ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lenja"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "これは？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "What's this?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ニーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Nina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "入ったばっかで頑張ってくれた褒美ってとこだ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Consider it a reward for working so hard on your first day."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "調査団員Ｂ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Survey Team Member B"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ふぅん。ありがと",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I see. Thanks."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ニーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Nina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ありがとうございます……はむっ。\nあれ、ニーナさんは食べないんですか？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Thank you very much... *munch* Oh? Aren't you going to eat yours, Miss Nina?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レイニャ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lenja"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あとで食べるわ。見慣れない果物だけど、味はどう？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I'll save it for later. I've never seen this fruit before—how does it taste?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ニーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Nina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "うっ……味は美味しいんですけど……臭いが……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ugh... The taste is good, but... the smell..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レイニャ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lenja"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そう。すぐに食べなくてよかった",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I see. Glad I waited."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ニーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Nina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ううっ。ニーナさん、まさかレイニャを実験台に！？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Uugh... Miss Nina, did you just use me as a test subject!?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レイニャ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lenja"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "さぁね～",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Who knows?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ニーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Nina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "離島に行った奴らが復帰して来るって本当か？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Is it true the team from the island is coming back?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "調査団員Ｃ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Survey Team Member C"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ええ。ですが私はまだ、詳しいことは知らないんです",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yes, though I don't know the details yet."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "調査団員Ａ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Survey Team Member A"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "離島？\u3000何かあったんでしょうか？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Island? Did something happen?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レイニャ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lenja"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "何でも、離島に流れ星が落ちたらしくて、調査団の\n主力がそこに調査に行ったらしいのよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Apparently a shooting star fell on some island, and the survey team's main force went to investigate."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ニーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Nina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そしたらそこには青い粒子が漂う領域ができてて、\n中に入った団員は調子を崩してたそうよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "They found an area filled with blue particles, and anyone who entered started feeling sick."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ニーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Nina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "青い粒子が漂う領域で、調子を崩した……？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "An area with blue particles made people sick...?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レイニャ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lenja"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そう。その人たちが今日、復帰するんですって",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "That's right. Those team members are supposed to return today."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ニーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Nina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "へぇ。そうなんですね……って、ど、どうして\nそんなことをニーナさんが知ってるんですか！？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Oh, I see... W-wait, how do you know all this, Miss Nina!?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レイニャ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lenja"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ああ。さっき仕事をしながら、色んな人に聞いたのよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Oh, I just asked around while working."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ニーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Nina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 21,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "レ、レイニャは働くので精一杯でした……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I-I was too busy just keeping up with the work..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レイニャ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lenja"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 22,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "一同、静粛に願います！\u3000団長殿です！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Attention everyone! The Director is here!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "調査団員Ａ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Survey Team Member A"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 23,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "皆には心配をかけてしまったが、ようやく\nこうして復帰できた",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I apologize for causing you all concern, but I'm finally able to return."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "調査団長",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Survey Team Director"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 24,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "さて。私はここに、神官長様の依頼を伝えよう",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Now then. I bring a request from the High Priest."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "調査団長",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Survey Team Director"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 25,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "し、神官長様の！？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "F-from the High Priest!?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "調査団員Ｂ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Survey Team Member B"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 26,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "神殿からの話は、まだ何も耳にしてないけど……\nいったい何だろうな",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "We haven't heard anything from the temple yet... I wonder what this is about?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "調査団員Ｃ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Survey Team Member C"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 27,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "諸君には、とあるブレスレットを作成してもらいたい。\n材料は――",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I need you all to craft certain bracelets. The materials are—"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "調査団長",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Survey Team Director"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 28,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "それでは諸君。よろしく頼む",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I'm counting on you all."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "調査団長",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Survey Team Director"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 29,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "なんでまたブレスレットなんか？\nそれにしても材料が大変だ、急いでかき集めないと",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Why bracelets of all things? And these materials will be a pain to gather..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "調査団員Ｃ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Survey Team Member C"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 30,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "しかし神官長様のご依頼ならば致し方ないでしょう。\nすべては、星の導きのままに",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Still, we can't refuse a request from the High Priest. All is guided by the stars."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "調査団員Ａ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Survey Team Member A"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 31,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "というわけです。君たち、頼みましたよ！！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "And that's the situation! I'm counting on you two!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "調査団員Ａ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Survey Team Member A"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 32,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "は、はいぃぃ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Y-yes sir!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レイニャ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lenja"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 33,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "はぁ。分かったわ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "*sigh* Alright."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ニーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Nina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 34,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "それにしても、あの団長様……様子が変だったわね。\nもっと休んでたほうがいいんじゃないかしら",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Still, something seemed off about the chief... Maybe they needed more rest."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ニーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Nina"
        }
      }
    }
  }
]